{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d069a9f7-e2fe-8193-91d3-35e6e3f23a58",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:24:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilza Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Kevin. My name is Nilza Spencer. I'm calling about a problem with the sidewalk, and let me explain it in order, if that's all right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:20:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. I'll jot things down as you talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:20:33-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the sidewalk in front of my building has heaved up. One of the slabs has lifted at the edge, so there's a lip, and next to it there's a hole where the surface has broken away. Last week I was walking out in the morning and I tripped on that lip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:20:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. Did you get hurt, or are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:21:03-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I caught myself, so I'm fine. I just want it reported before somebody else goes down. And the other thing is that the hole has been filling up with water from the rain. So it's hard to see how deep it is, and it looks like a puddle. You'd step right in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:21:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so a puddle hiding a hole. That's the kind of thing that catches people. Let me get the location. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:21:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 103 Eustis Avenue. That's in the Historic Hill area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:21:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One-oh-three Eustis Avenue. And it's the sidewalk right out front of the building, not the street itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:21:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, the sidewalk. The slab that's lifted is on the side nearest the front steps, and the hole is just past it toward the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:22:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Heaved slab by the front steps, broken hole toward the corner, full of water. When did you first notice it, roughly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:22:10-05:00",
      "duration": 33,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me think. It was getting worse over the last few weeks. The lip was there a while, but the hole opened up more recently. I tripped on it last Tuesday, I believe. I remember because I looked at the clock on my microwave to see what time it was, and it was blinking twelve. We had a power flicker the night before, so I had no idea of the real time. I had to check my phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:22:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, those blinking twelves. Okay, so last Tuesday for the fall. I'll put that in the notes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Can I ask how long repairs like this usually take? Just so I know what to expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:23:00-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the backlog. Sidewalk work can take a few weeks, sometimes longer in the winter when the weather limits what they can do. Someone usually goes out and looks at it first, and if it's a trip hazard they can sometimes mark it or patch it sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:23:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So an inspection first, and then the repair after that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:23:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the usual order, yes. Do you want a call back when someone's been out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:23:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. My number is 401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:23:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-seven. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:23:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:23:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And it's Nilza Spencer, S-P-E-N-C-E-R?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So I have a heaved sidewalk slab and a water-filled hole at 103 Eustis Avenue, a trip on it last Tuesday, and a callback to you at that number. I'll send it over to the sidewalk crew today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:24:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's everything. I appreciate your help, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:24:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Take care, and watch your step out there in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:24:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
